    "During rebase, Ours is the branch being rebased onto; Theirs is the commit being replayed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rebase 时，“当前一方”是目标基底，“传入一方”是正在重放的提交。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rebase中の「現在の側」は移動先のブランチ、「取り込む側」は再適用中のコミットです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit each file, then explicitly confirm its resolution. Continue only after every conflict is resolved and your edits are staged.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐个编辑文件并确认解决。所有冲突解决且编辑内容已暂存后，才能继续操作。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各ファイルを編集し、解決を確定してください。すべての競合を解決して編集内容をステージしてから続行できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edited file imported. Review the working file, then confirm resolution.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已导入编辑结果，请查看工作文件后确认解决。"
